              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ef 6:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ma! Abota atala lyamalundu maulu aayooyo uuleta makani mabotu, uulwiida bantu makani aaluumuno, uuleta makani mabotu loko, uulwiida bantu makani aalufutuko, uuambila Zioni kuti, Leza wako nguuendelezya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 52:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ZEP.3.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zef 3:9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Swiilila ijwi lyabalindizi bako! Swiilila mbuboonzomoka akwiimba boonse antoomwe! Nkaambo bayoobonana kumeso, Jehova naayooboola ku-Zioni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 52:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amutalike kwiimba nyoonse numatongo aa-Jerusalemu, nkaambo Jehova waumuzya bantu bakwe, wanununa Jerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 52:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.3.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lk 3:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jehova wavumbulula kuboko kwakwe kusalala mumeso aamikowa yoonse, nkabela magolelo oonse aanyika ayoobona lufutuko lwa-Leza wesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
